@startuml ניהול דוחות - Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #f8f9fa

title Sequence: ניהול דוחות (Reports Management)

actor "מנהל/מוכר\n(Admin/Seller)" as Admin
participant "Frontend\n(React App)" as Frontend
participant "Reports Controller\n(Backend)" as ReportsController
participant "Reports Service\n(Business Logic)" as ReportsService
participant "Analytics Service\n(Analytics Logic)" as AnalyticsService
participant "Database\n(MongoDB)" as Database

Admin -> Frontend: 1. כניסה לעמוד הדוחות
activate Frontend

Frontend -> ReportsController: 2. GET /api/reports/dashboard
activate ReportsController

ReportsController -> ReportsService: 3. getDashboardData(userId, role)
activate ReportsService

ReportsService -> Database: 4. aggregate sales data
activate Database

Database --> ReportsService: 5. נתוני מכירות
deactivate Database

ReportsService -> Database: 6. aggregate orders data
activate Database

Database --> ReportsService: 7. נתוני הזמנות
deactivate Database

ReportsService -> AnalyticsService: 8. calculateMetrics(salesData, ordersData)
activate AnalyticsService

AnalyticsService --> ReportsService: 9. מדדים מחושבים
deactivate AnalyticsService

ReportsService --> ReportsController: 10. דוח דשבורד מלא
deactivate ReportsService

ReportsController --> Frontend: 11. 200 OK + dashboard data
deactivate ReportsController

Frontend --> Admin: 12. הצגת דשבורד דוחות
deactivate Frontend

== יצירת דוח מותאם ==

Admin -> Frontend: 13. בחירת פרמטרי דוח
activate Frontend

Frontend -> ReportsController: 14. POST /api/reports/custom
note right: {dateRange, reportType, filters}
activate ReportsController

ReportsController -> ReportsService: 15. generateCustomReport(params)
activate ReportsService

ReportsService -> Database: 16. complex aggregation query
activate Database

Database --> ReportsService: 17. נתונים מסוננים
deactivate Database

ReportsService -> AnalyticsService: 18. processReportData(rawData)
activate AnalyticsService

AnalyticsService --> ReportsService: 19. דוח מעובד
deactivate AnalyticsService

ReportsService -> ReportsService: 20. formatForExport(reportData)

ReportsService --> ReportsController: 21. דוח מוכן + קובץ
deactivate ReportsService

ReportsController --> Frontend: 22. 200 OK + report + download link
deactivate ReportsController

Frontend --> Admin: 23. הצגת דוח + אפשרות הורדה
deactivate Frontend

== ייצוא דוח ==

Admin -> Frontend: 24. לחיצה על "ייצוא"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> ReportsController: 25. GET /api/reports/export/:reportId
activate ReportsController

ReportsController -> ReportsService: 26. exportReport(reportId, format)
activate ReportsService

ReportsService -> Database: 27. findReportById(reportId)
activate Database

Database --> ReportsService: 28. נתוני דוח
deactivate Database

ReportsService -> ReportsService: 29. convertToFormat(data, format)

ReportsService --> ReportsController: 30. קובץ מוכן להורדה
deactivate ReportsService

ReportsController --> Frontend: 31. 200 OK + file stream
deactivate ReportsController

Frontend --> Admin: 32. הורדת קובץ
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
